{"When immediateDelete is true, the reminder is cancelled in SendGrid but not deleted from the database, so it will remain in the database forever": 0.891416609287262, "SendGrid cancellation request will fail if reminder.referenceId is null, but remindersToCancel includes records where cancelled: true without checking if referenceId exists": 0.855198323726654, "If any SendGrid cancellation fails in the loop, the catch block will prevent all reminders from being deleted from the database (the Promise.all is skipped), meaning failed cancellations will be retried on every CRON run": 0.9068593978881836, "Errors during cancellation are caught and logged but don't stop the booking flow - unclear if reschedule operations should fail if reminder cancellation fails, or if silent failure is acceptable": 0.0901125818490982, "The cancelled field is nullable rather than defaulting to false, which means existing records will have null values": 0.39519205689430237}